-We do book clubs differently
on our show, but yeah.

00:00:20.152 --> 00:00:22.855
Eventually,
I'll read one of them, yeah.

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:24.524
We do love books here
on the show.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.993
But, anyways,
these are all fantastic books.

