00:04:06.979 --> 00:04:09.515 line:0%
"One Last Stop"?
Oh, "H Mart" -- I like this one.

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:10.516 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:04:10.516 --> 00:04:12.351
-Alright, so, here we go.
Which one?

00:04:12.351 --> 00:04:13.719
In no order,
'cause they're all good.

00:04:13.719 --> 00:04:14.954
-That one.
-Which one?

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:16.923
-That one in your hand.

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:18.390
Yeah. No.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:21.126
-I'm gonna do
"Razorblade tears."

00:04:21.126 --> 00:04:22.128
-First line of
"Razorblade Tears."

00:04:22.128 --> 00:04:23.729
-First line.

00:04:23.729 --> 00:04:26.999
"Ike tried to remember a time
when men with badges

00:04:26.999 --> 00:04:28.534
coming to his door
early in the morning

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:30.703
